  "body": "When Tracearr returns absolute URLs for avatars or posters, the `proxyImageAsync` method incorrectly passed them through\r\n  `this.url()`, concatenating the integration base URL with the absolute URL. This produced malformed URLs like\r\n  `https://tracearr.mydomain.nethttps://tracearr.mydomain.net/...`, causing repeated DNS lookups for\r\n  `tracearr.mydomain.nethttps`.\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/homarr-labs/homarr/issues/5342",
